Output ../scorecard.gif
Output ../scorecard.mp4

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1280
Set Height 980
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 4ms

Hide
Type "cd /workspace"
Enter
Show

Type "python3 labs/02-sleeper-memory/media/show.py scorecard"
Enter
Sleep 14s
